                                "sense_id": "136787be-97e5-31f0-86f5-5591a2df7798",
                                "text": "'Zounds, a dog, a rat, a mouse, a cat, to scratch a man to death!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73bc5b02-9ec3-4cd6-92ea-3a6060dcf73b",
                                "sense_id": "136787be-97e5-31f0-86f5-5591a2df7798",
                                "text": "Bounds, mounds, lounds, founds, kounds, downds, rounds, pounds, zounds! — hounds — ha! hounds — I have it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23f4d192-356e-4730-ad49-e2876c908e10",
                                "sense_id": "136787be-97e5-31f0-86f5-5591a2df7798",
                                "text": "\"Zounds!\" he exclaimed. \"What the dickens is that?\""
                            }
                        ]
